# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Shaded lightcones"
msgstr "Petunjuk instalasi untuk versi terbaru Shaded lightcones"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Petunjuk instalasi"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Petunjuk instalasi {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, choose how you’re going to run and install the packages. There are two primary ways to do this:\n"
msgstr "Pertama, pilih bagaimana kamu akan menjalankan dan menginstal paket-paketnya. Ada dua cara utama untuk melakukannya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 1: Install from PyPI](#option-1)\n"
msgstr "[Opsi 1: Instal dari PyPI](#option-1)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 2: Install from Source](#option-2)\n"
msgstr "[Opsi 2: Instal dari Source](#option-2)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prasyarat {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Pertama, buat lingkungan minimal yang hanya berisi Python. Kami merekomendasikan memakai [virtual environment Python](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktifkan lingkungan barumu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-1\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 1: Install from PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Opsi 1: Instal dari PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The most straightforward way to install the `qiskit-addon-slc` package is via `PyPI`.\n"
msgstr "Cara paling mudah untuk menginstal paket `qiskit-addon-slc` adalah lewat `PyPI`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-2\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 2: Install from Source {#option-2-install-from-source}"
msgstr "Opsi 2: Instal dari Source {#option-2-install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally, install from source.\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu berencana mengembangkan di dalam repositori atau menjalankan notebook secara lokal, instal dari source.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If so, the first step is to clone the `qiskit-addon-slc` repository.\n"
msgstr "Kalau iya, langkah pertama adalah meng-clone repositori `qiskit-addon-slc`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade `pip` and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "Selanjutnya, upgrade `pip` lalu masuk ke repositorinya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-addon-slc` to the virtual environment. Install the notebook dependencies if you plan to run all the visualizations in the notebooks. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Langkah berikutnya adalah menginstal `qiskit-addon-slc` ke virtual environment. Instal dependensi notebook kalau kamu berencana menjalankan semua visualisasi di notebook. Kalau kamu berencana mengembangkan di dalam repositori, instal dependensi `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Sesuaikan opsi di bawah ini dengan kebutuhanmu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs.\n"
msgstr "Kalau kamu sudah menginstal dependensi notebook, kamu bisa mulai dengan menjalankan notebook yang ada di dokumentasi.\n"
